   "reason": "Scala accessors of the list constant, and the type that makes a list's form follow from its element type, which the builtin denotations, case, costing, Flat encoding and equality read; the reference applies Haskell's own list functions to its list value (null, head, length) and has one form, so they have no counterpart of their own",
